{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "أَخَذْنَا", "translation": "We took"}, {"text": "مِيثَـٰقَكُمْ", "translation": "your covenant"}, {"text": "وَرَفَعْنَا", "translation": "and We raised"}, {"text": "فَوْقَكُمُ", "translation": "over you"}, {"text": "ٱلطُّورَ", "translation": "the mount"}, {"text": "خُذُوا۟", "translation": "Hold"}, {"text": "مَآ", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "ءَاتَيْنَـٰكُم", "translation": "We gave you"}, {"text": "بِقُوَّةٍۢ", "translation": "with firmness"}, {"text": "وَٱسْمَعُوا۟ ۖ", "translation": "and listen"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "They said"}, {"text": "سَمِعْنَا", "translation": "We heard"}, {"text": "وَعَصَيْنَا", "translation": "and we disobeyed"}, {"text": "وَأُشْرِبُوا۟", "translation": "And they were made to drink"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "قُلُوبِهِمُ", "translation": "their hearts"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِجْلَ", "translation": "(love of) the calf"}, {"text": "بِكُفْرِهِمْ ۚ", "translation": "because of their disbelief"}, {"text": "قُلْ", "translation": "Say"}, {"text": "بِئْسَمَا", "translation": "Evil (is) that"}, {"text": "يَأْمُرُكُم", "translation": "orders you (to do) it"}, {"text": "بِهِۦٓ", "translation": "with"}, {"text": "إِيمَـٰنُكُمْ", "translation": "your faith"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "كُنتُم", "translation": "you are"}, {"text": "مُّؤْمِنِينَ", "translation": "believers"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when We took your covenant and raised over you the mount, [saying], \"Take what We have given you with determination and listen.\" They said [instead], \"We hear and disobey.\" And their hearts absorbed [the worship of] the calf because of their disbelief. Say, \"How wretched is that which your faith enjoins upon you, if you should be believers.\""}